// BT-4001: superclass of Bt4001ClassSuperActorChild. The instance-side
// `peek:` answers something else, so a class-side `super peek:` that wrongly
// resolved against instance methods would be visible.

Actor subclass: Bt4001ClassSuperActorBase

  class peek: x => x + 100

  peek: x => x + 1000
